221o|a|Of or pertaining to synergism. ; Cooperating; synergetic.	j:xn,115,3~xn,115,3
222b|n|One of two or more words (commonly words of the same language) which are equivalents of each other; one of two or more words which have very nearly the same signification, and therefore may often be used interchangeably. See under Synonymous.	a:229p,42,7~229p,42,7	n:229p,60,26~229p,60,26	N:20wg,58,6;1gxs,41,4;229p,29,3~20wg,58,6;1gxs,41,4;229p,29,3
